# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DervGen Ecosystem — Canonical .gitattributes Template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LF-Only Policy: all text files are stored with LF in the repository and
# checked out as LF on every OS, including Windows. CRLF is NEVER used
# except for Windows-native batch files (.bat/.cmd).
#
# This file is the SSOT for line-ending policy across the DervGen ecosystem.
# See: all-overview/architecture/line-ending-standards.md
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║  GLOBAL DEFAULT                                                          ║
# ║  Auto-detect text files; force LF on checkout AND commit on every OS.   ║
# ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
* text=auto eol=lf

